{"id":"c0fe5eb4041a169e","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-pcf-theory.md","title":"PCF Theory","display":"df-pcf-theory — PCF Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-pcf-theory","aliases":["58-df-pcf-theory","PCF Theory"],"display":"df-pcf-theory — PCF Theory","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-pcf-true-cofinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-pcf-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-pcf-theory</span><span>PCF Theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pcf-theory — PCF Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e0fb35e7cde9e6b\" href=\"?note=4e0fb35e7cde9e6b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf-true-cofinality.md\">58-df-zfc-pcf-true-cofinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\lambda,U,E,R,P\\in V\">\\(A,\\lambda,U,E,R,P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcfTrueCofinality}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcfTrueCofinality}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e0fb35e7cde9e6b\" href=\"?note=4e0fb35e7cde9e6b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf-true-cofinality.md\">58-df-zfc-pcf-true-cofinality.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}:V\\to V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U,E,R,P\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\land A\\in U\\land\\varnothing\\notin U\n\\land\\forall B,C\\in U\\;(B\\cap C\\in U)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall B\\in U\\;\\forall C\\;\\bigl(B\\subseteq C\\subseteq A\\to C\\in U\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall B\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(B\\in U\\lor A\\setminus B\\in U\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land E\\subseteq\\left(\\prod_{\\kappa\\in A}\\kappa\\right)^2\n\\land\\forall f,g\\in\\prod_{\\kappa\\in A}\\kappa\\;\\left(\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\kappa\\in A:f(\\kappa)=g(\\kappa)\\}\\in U\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land P=\\left(\\prod_{\\kappa\\in A}\\kappa\\right)/E\\land R\\subseteq P^2\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall f,g\\in\\prod_{\\kappa\\in A}\\kappa\\;\\left(\\langle[f]_E,[g]_E\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\kappa\\in A:f(\\kappa)\\leq g(\\kappa)\\}\\in U\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcfTrueCofinality}_S(P,R,\\lambda)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U,E,R,P\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\land A\\in U\\land\\varnothing\\notin U\n\\land\\forall B,C\\in U\\;(B\\cap C\\in U)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall B\\in U\\;\\forall C\\;\\bigl(B\\subseteq C\\subseteq A\\to C\\in U\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall B\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(B\\in U\\lor A\\setminus B\\in U\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land E\\subseteq\\left(\\prod_{\\kappa\\in A}\\kappa\\right)^2\n\\land\\forall f,g\\in\\prod_{\\kappa\\in A}\\kappa\\;\\left(\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\kappa\\in A:f(\\kappa)=g(\\kappa)\\}\\in U\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land P=\\left(\\prod_{\\kappa\\in A}\\kappa\\right)/E\\land R\\subseteq P^2\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall f,g\\in\\prod_{\\kappa\\in A}\\kappa\\;\\left(\\langle[f]_E,[g]_E\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\kappa\\in A:f(\\kappa)\\leq g(\\kappa)\\}\\in U\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcfTrueCofinality}_S(P,R,\\lambda)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Standard pcf theory takes a nonempty <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Reg}\">\\(A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Reg}\\)</span>; the hypothesis <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|&lt;\\min(A)\">\\(|A|&lt;\\min(A)\\)</span> is the progressive condition used by the main structure theorems.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> is equality modulo <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> is the corresponding reduced product, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> is its modulo-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> order.  The definition uses true cofinality of this ordered quotient, not ordinal cofinality applied to its carrier.</li>\n<li>Pseudo-power at a singular cardinal is a separate supremum over true cofinalities of cofinal products; it is not simply <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup\\operatorname{pcf}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\sup\\operatorname{pcf}(\\kappa)\\)</span> with a cardinal as argument.</li>\n<li>Scales: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-long scales in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod \\kappa_i / J^{\\operatorname{bd}}\">\\(\\prod \\kappa_i / J^{\\operatorname{bd}}\\)</span>; proved in ZFC</li>\n<li>Cardinal arithmetic: PCF gives sharp bounds on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\aleph_\\omega)^\\omega\">\\((\\aleph_\\omega)^\\omega\\)</span>; Jónsson at singular</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Abraham and Magidor, Cardinal Arithmetic</li>\n<li>Shelah, Cardinal Arithmetic</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf-true-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"4e0fb35e7cde9e6b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf-true-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{cf}:V\\rightharpoonup V$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf-true-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"4e0fb35e7cde9e6b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcfTrueCofinality}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-pcf-true-cofinality.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\lambda,U,E,R,P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}:V\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcfTrueCofinality}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U,E,R,P\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\land A\\in U\\land\\varnothing\\notin U\n\\land\\forall B,C\\in U\\;(B\\cap C\\in U)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall B\\in U\\;\\forall C\\;\\bigl(B\\subseteq C\\subseteq A\\to C\\in U\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall B\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(B\\in U\\lor A\\setminus B\\in U\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land E\\subseteq\\left(\\prod_{\\kappa\\in A}\\kappa\\right)^2\n\\land\\forall f,g\\in\\prod_{\\kappa\\in A}\\kappa\\;\\left(\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\kappa\\in A:f(\\kappa)=g(\\kappa)\\}\\in U\\right)\\\\\n&{}\\land P=\\left(\\prod_{\\kappa\\in A}\\kappa\\right)/E\\land R\\subseteq P^2\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall f,g\\in\\prod_{\\kappa\\in A}\\kappa\\;\\left(\\langle[f]_E,[g]_E\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\kappa\\in A:f(\\kappa)\\leq g(\\kappa)\\}\\in U\\right)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcfTrueCofinality}_S(P,R,\\lambda)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Reg}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|<\\min(A)","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup\\operatorname{pcf}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod \\kappa_i / J^{\\operatorname{bd}}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\aleph_\\omega)^\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2586,"backlinks":[{"id":"68f7dcaae0b215fe","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-231","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-pcf-theory]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-949","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-pcf-theory.md|58-df-pcf-theory]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["315ad00b8744fdfc","5fb1c2241d1943d1","4e0fb35e7cde9e6b"]}